---
import { Scale } from 'lucide-react';
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

{/* Section 2: Real Alternatives */}
<Section
  id="value"
  title="The Real 'Bonuses': Value You Can Actually Keep"
  icon={Scale}
>
  <p class="leading-relaxed mb-8">
    If they don't give you upfront cash, what <em>do</em> they give you? In my testing
    of the 2026 landscape, Pepperstone replaces the "sugar rush" of a bonus with
    the "nutrition" of low costs and better tools. Let's break down the math.
  </p>

  {/* Comparison Table */}
  <div
    class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-lg mb-10"
  >
    <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
      <thead>
        <tr class="bg-slate-900 text-white">
          <th class="p-4 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider w-1/4">
            Value Feature
          </th>
          <th class="p-4 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider w-1/4">
            What It Is
          </th>
          <th
            class="p-4 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider w-1/4 hidden md:table-cell"
          >
            Tangible Benefit
          </th>
          <th
            class="p-4 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider bg-blue-700"
          >
            Why It Beats a Bonus
          </th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100 bg-white">
        <tr>
          <td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-800">
            Superior Execution & Spreads
          </td>
          <td class="p-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
            Raw pricing with razor-thin spreads (e.g., competitive averages on
            EUR/USD).
          </td>
          <td class="p-4 text-sm text-slate-600 hidden md:table-cell">
            Lower cost per trade = higher profit retention.
          </td>
          <td class="p-4 text-sm bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 font-medium">
            A 0.1 pip saving on every trade creates more wealth over 6 months
            than a one-time 20% credit.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-800"> Advanced Platforms </td>
          <td class="p-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
            Full access to MT4, MT5, cTrader, and TradingView.
          </td>
          <td class="p-4 text-sm text-slate-600 hidden md:table-cell">
            Professional tools for precise analysis.
          </td>
          <td class="p-4 text-sm bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 font-medium">
            Skill development is the engine of income. A bonus is just fuel; the
            platform is the engine.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-800"> Risk Management Tools </td>
          <td class="p-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
            Negative balance protection & smart calculators.
          </td>
          <td class="p-4 text-sm text-slate-600 hidden md:table-cell">
            Protects your capital from market gaps.
          </td>
          <td class="p-4 text-sm bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 font-medium">
            Keeping your own money safe is infinitely more valuable than getting
            "free" money you can't withdraw.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-800"> Local Support </td>
          <td class="p-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
            Support that understands the Nairobi session.
          </td>
          <td class="p-4 text-sm text-slate-600 hidden md:table-cell">
            Quick resolution of issues.
          </td>
          <td class="p-4 text-sm bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 font-medium">
            Downtime costs money. Efficient support saves it.
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 italic mt-2 text-center">
    Table 1: A comparative analysis of Pepperstone's value proposition vs.
    traditional bonus models.
  </p>
</Section>
